  "description": "Survey of India sheet 56 K/7/SE, 1:25,000, first edition 1975, surveyed 1973-74. Covers 78 22'30\" to 78 30' E, 17 15' to 17 22'30\" N: the Old City, Mir Alam tank and south towards Shamshabad. It joins the sheet above it (the layer '1975 56K7', which is 56 K/7/NE) along 17 22'30\" N. Georeferenced on its four corners on the Indian datum (Kalianpur 1975).",
